 "text": "Anthropics has shipped an AI that won't spend your money without asking. It's called Claude Duet. It works in the background, and before it pays for anything, it stops and waits for your yes. That's the part people are skipping. The risk with AI agents was never that they're dumb. It's that they act without you. A single approval step fixes that. And it's how we build every system for our clients. Want the five starter skills I give every new AI employee? Comment AI and I'll send them."
